msgid "1. Set the start date; 2. import paid WooCommerce orders page by page; 3. enter actual supplier invoices and expenses; 4. verify tax classification and the issued invoice before validating an entry; 5. review months and export the ledger for your accountant."
msgstr "1. Set the start date; 2. import paid WooCommerce orders page by page; 3. enter actual supplier invoices and expenses; 4. verify tax classification and the issued invoice before validating an entry; 5. review months and export the ledger for your accountant."

