msgid "All records live in a dedicated WordPress-prefix table, with unique source/source_id keys. Imports use WooCommerce WC_Order APIs and never change orders. No TaxoCommerce sibling is required. Validated entries are immutable; corrections need a new adjustment record in a later version."
msgstr "All records live in a dedicated WordPress-prefix table, with unique source/source_id keys. Imports use WooCommerce WC_Order APIs and never change orders. No TaxoCommerce sibling is required. Validated entries are immutable; corrections need a new adjustment record in a later version."

