msgstr "Year contains over 400 entries; use the exports for full reporting. This dashboard is limited."

msgid "Invoice storage is unavailable."
msgstr "Le stockage des factures est indisponible."

msgid "Secure invoice encryption is unavailable."
msgstr "Le chiffrement sécurisé des factures est indisponible."

